    "senderName": "NWS Paducah KY",
    "headline": "Heat Advisory issued September 14 at 10:23PM CDT until September 16 at 7:00PM CDT by NWS Paducah KY",
    "description": "* WHAT...Daily peak heat index values around 105 degrees.\n\n* WHERE...Portions of southern Illinois, southwest Indiana, western\nKentucky, and southeast Missouri.\n\n* WHEN...From 11 AM CDT /noon EDT/ Tuesday to 7 PM CDT /8 PM EDT/\nWednesday.\n\n* IMPACTS...Hot temperatures and high humidity may cause hea",
    "instruction": "Drink plenty of fluids, stay in an air-conditioned room, stay out of\nthe sun, and check up on relatives and neighbors.\n\nTake extra precautions when outside. Wear lightweight and loose\nfitting clothing. Try to limit strenuous activities to early morning\nor evening. Take action when you see symptoms of heat exhaustion and\nheat stroke.",
    "response": "Execute",
